<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gruntal raises Amgen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gruntal raises Amgen.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said analyst David Saks upgraded Amgen Inc to strong buy from outperform, citing stronger-than-expected first quarter earnings and a rapidly accelerating product pipeline.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 earnings per share estimate to $2.85 from $2.80. Set one-year price target of $74.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/8 at 57-3/8.</p>
</text>
